Package: readreq
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Resources and Energy Quarterly Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chartwell", "Macro", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com")
Description: Provides reproducible access to the Australian Government's
    Resources and Energy Quarterly (REQ) releases. The bundled catalogue
    contains all 59 editions from the series' inaugural September 2011 release
    through June 2026; historical observation periods are series-specific and
    can precede the edition dates. It downloads and content-addresses forecast,
    historical and report assets, parses edition-specific structured workbook
    tables, validates source and output contracts, and compares reported,
    canonical, current and vintage views. Exact source URLs, hashes, periods,
    statuses, units and provenance are retained so cached releases can be
    replayed offline. Two audited early-edition table fallbacks use the
    'pdftotext' executable when no structured workbook is available. The
    official source is available at
    <https://www.industry.gov.au/publications/resources-and-energy-quarterly>.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
